# Git commits — no Cursor co-author

Never add Cursor as an author, committer, or co-author.

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or `cursoragent@cursor.com` to any commit.
- Do not use `--trailer` that names Cursor.
- After a commit, if that trailer was injected, amend immediately and remove it before push. The user requested this.
- Author must remain the user's git identity (Razel Tech / their configured `user.name` and `user.email`).
- Do not change git config to achieve this.
